    lines+=['','Exit diagnosis with predefined good entries',f'On {diagnostic["entry_points"]} held-out target-entry examples, the learned exit averaged {diagnostic["mean_learned_exit_return_pct"]:.2f}% versus a hindsight best {diagnostic["mean_oracle_return_pct"]:.2f}%.',f'Aggregate capture for these same entry points: {diagnostic["aggregate_capture_pct"]:.2f}%.',diagnostic['limit'],'Nearby positive entry points can belong to the same rally, so these are not all','independent rallies. This diagnostic does not imply the entry model can find them.','',
    'Selection and limits','Entry checkpoints use validation average precision. Exit checkpoints/thresholds','use return at fixed teacher validation entries. End-to-end validation chooses','the entry threshold with cash available. All source/label timestamps and model','selection precede the outer test. Labels mature48h32m after a decision; an','additional24h purge separates training labels from validation and test windows.','Validation starts with the latest two eligible dates and expands by dates until','at least five positive targets exist. Sparse positives make this selection noisy.','',
    'An initial replay assertion found an archive-boundary mistake; it was repaired','before delivery and all fits were rerun. A coverage check also found the initial','20%-of-history validation split left no news in the outer training sets. The','shorter coverage-based split above replaced it. Preliminary outcomes had been','viewed. Those runs are preserved; changes are recorded in the experiment lock.','These dates were already examined in earlier research and the SOPH example was','previously inspected. They are unseen to each fitted model, not pristine research','holdouts. The changed all-token universe prevents direct dollar comparisons with','the older SMA-gated study. This is not a validated dependable trading edge.','',
    'Saved final policy',f'Latest validation chose cash: {config["cash"]}. Entry threshold: {config["entry_threshold"]}; exit threshold: {config["exit_threshold"]}.','Both trained models are saved even when validation chooses to abstain. The final','models have no later prospective test in this archive.','',
    'Verification',f'Passed: {validation["recomputed_trade_payoffs"]} trade-payoff checks, {validation["trades_checked_against_original_minute_records"]} original-minute source checks, {validation["independent_asof_news_story_count_checks"]} independent as-of news counts, {validation["teacher_exit_upper_bounds_checked"]} teacher exit bounds, and {validation["saved_model_action_calls"]} saved-model action calls.',f'Independent full oracle searches checked on {validation["unit_checks"]["independent_full_teacher_searches"]} target rallies. Both models pass numerical gradient checks.','No executed-position overlap; no news columns accepted by the exit API. Source','timestamps are checked, but exact historical publication/network latency and','later exchange corrections are not independently established.','',
    'Artifacts','entry_model.joblib and exit_model.joblib: separate trained networks/scalers.','policy_two.py and policy-config.json: callable offline decisions and selection.','README.txt: reproduction and input requirements. predictions.csv: all test trades.','teacher-exit-diagnostic.csv: same-entry exit diagnostic. results.json and','selection-audit.json: exact metrics and full chronology. Persistent raw cache: ',PATHS['external_windows']]
    (HERE/'REPORT.txt').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
    plt.rcParams.update({'axes.spines.top':False,'axes.spines.right':False});fig,ax=plt.subplots(1,2,figsize=(11,4.8),layout='constrained');values=[result['comparisons'][p]['all']['gross_profit_usd'] for p in ['two_stage','entry_fixed24h','cash']];bars=ax[0].bar(['Two models','Fixed24h exit','Cash'],values,color=['#2563eb' if v>=0 else '#dc2626' for v in values]);ax[0].bar_label(bars,fmt='%.2f',padding=4);ax[0].axhline(0,color='gray',lw=.8);ax[0].set_title('All chronological replay folds');ax[0].set_ylabel('Gross USD;100 USD per trade');ax[0].margins(y=.2)
    values=[diagnostic['mean_learned_exit_return_pct'],diagnostic['mean_oracle_return_pct']];bars=ax[1].bar(['Learned exit','Hindsight best'],values,color=['#2563eb','#94a3b8']);ax[1].bar_label(bars,fmt='%.2f%%',padding=4);ax[1].set_title('Diagnostic: same hindsight-good entries');ax[1].set_ylabel('Mean trade return (%)');ax[1].margins(y=.2);news_profit=result['comparisons']['two_stage']['news_trained_model']['gross_profit_usd'];fig.suptitle(f'Entry with news; exit without news — fees excluded\n{validation["news_trained_test_folds"]} outer fold trained on news; its result was {news_profit:+.2f} USD',fontsize=12);fig.savefig(HERE/'results.png',dpi=160);fig.savefig(HERE/'results.pdf');plt.close(fig)
